 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum3467 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum3493 (k215PVector u c (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage0At3467) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage1At3467) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage2At3467) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage3At3467) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage4At3467) k215PushAStage5At3467)))));

